    At $m = b \/ 2$, the pair-row moment bounds of Lemma 13 imply
  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(4.6)")
   $ parallel macron(B)_b \( s \) - B_(t \, b) parallel lt.eq
     C sqrt(w) thin frac(w^2, \( v + B \)^2) . $ <eq:pinning-rounded-row-error>]
